r Sean McCann, with a Green candidate also on the ballot. Nearly every professional rater calls the race a tossup, with a few outlets tilting slightly Republican and one leaning Democratic; prediction markets narrowly favor Huizenga.\n\nThe only recent public poll, a September survey of likely voters, showed McCann ahead by a single point. Huizenga holds a modest cash advantage, but outside groups have spent more than $1.1 million attacking him, evidence of how contested the seat is. McCann has campaigned heavily in Kalamazoo with Pete Buttigieg, while Huizenga has emphasized labor and energy issues amid rising gas prices. Both parties treat the outcome as pivotal to House control.", "history": [{"date": "2026-09-22", "p_dem": 0.5309, "margin": 0.42}, {"date": "2026-09-23", "p_dem": 0.4667, "margin": -1.0}, {"date": "2026-09-24", "p_dem": 0.4711, "margin": -1.0}, {"date": "2026-09-25", "p_dem": 0.4732, "margin": -1.0}, {"date": "2026-09-26", "p_dem": 0.4842, "margin": 0.3}, {"date": "2026-09-27", "p_dem": 0.4178, "margin": -0.7}, {"date": "2026-09-28", "p_dem": 0.4942, "margin": -0.5}, {"date": "2026-09-29", "p_dem": 0.4707, "margin": -1.0}, {"date": "2026-09-30", "p_dem": 0.417, "margin": -1.5}, {"date": "2026-10-01", "p_dem": 0.4657, "margin": -1.0}, {"date": "2026-10-02", "p_dem": 0.5306, "margin": 0.0}, {"date": "2026-10-03", "p_dem": 0.4314, "margin": -1.5}, {"date": "2026-10-04", "p_dem": 0.5595, "margin": 0.4}, {"date": "2026-10-05", "p_dem": 0.4501, "margin": -0.3}, {"date": "2026-10-06", "p_dem": 0.5027, "margin": 0.5}, {"date": "2026-10-07", "p_dem": 0.4045, "margin": -1.0}, {"date": "2026-10-08", "p_dem": 0.4996, "margin": 0.0}, {"date": "2026-10-09", "p_dem": 0.4991, "margin": 0.5}, {"date": "2026-10-10", "p_dem": 0.5016, "margin": 0.5}, {"date": "2026-10-11", "p_dem": 0.4704, "margin": 0.0}, {"date": "2026-10-12", "p_dem": 0.501, "margin": -0.5}, {"date": "2026-10-13", "p_dem": 0.5344, "margin": 0.5}, {"date": "2026-10-14", "p_dem": 0.5319, "margin": 0.